{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40685","headline":"秋日同觉公上人眺慈恩塔六韵 · 李洞","name":"秋日同觉公上人眺慈恩塔六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九级耸莲宫，晴登袖拂虹。\n房廊窥井底，世界出笼中。\n照牖三山火，吹铃八极风。\n细闻槎客语，遥辨海鱼冲。\n禁静声连北，江寒影在东。\n谒师开秘锁，尘日闭虚空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}